{
 "MonitoringProgramDescription": "The SEZ Basinwide Monitoring and Assessment Plan provides the methods and protocals to assess the current status and long-term trends of SEZs on a Basin-wide scale. The Plan will also provide a means to evaluate the impacts of ongoing and future management actions, identify regional impairments, and detect long-term trends that can inform sound future SEZ policy.",
 "MonitoringApproach": "SEZ function is evaluated as a function of up to 10 indicators. Details on each indicator and monitoring methods are available in the plan.\n\nResults from the program are compiled on the Lake Tahoe SEZ Viewer: https://gis.trpa.org/TahoeSEZViewer/",
